{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":54,"count":35,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-2-05\",\"来\",\"來\",\"来\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他今天不來學校嗎？","pinyin":"Tā jīntiān bù lái xuéxiào ma?","english":"Isn’t he coming to school today?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-05","sourceFront":"來","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"謝謝！明天晚上六點來我家，好不好？","pinyin":"Xièxie! Míngtiān wǎnshang liù diǎn lái wǒ jiā, hǎo bù hǎo?","english":"Thanks! How about coming to my place at 6 p.m. tomorrow?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"今天是星期五，明天是週末，你們要不要來我家？","pinyin":"Jīntiān shì xīngqí wǔ, míngtiān shì zhōumò, nǐmen yào bú yào lái wǒ jiā?","english":"Today is Friday and it is the weekend tomorrow. Do you want to come to my place?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我在學校，你要來這裡嗎？","pinyin":"Wǒ zài xuéxiào, nǐ yào lái zhèlǐ ma?","english":"I am at the school. Do you want to come here? (Are you coming?)","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-10","sourceFront":"這裡/這兒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"朋友常來找我，他們都覺得坐捷運來我家，又快又方便。","pinyin":"Péngyǒu cháng lái zhǎo wǒ, tāmen dōu juéde zuò jiéyùn lái wǒ jiā, yòu kuài yòu fāngbiàn.","english":"My friends often visit me. They all think taking the MRT to my house is both fast and convenient.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"沒關係，我們可以下個週末再來看。對了，妳要買鞋子吧？","pinyin":"Méiguānxi, wǒmen kěyǐ xià ge zhōumò zài lái kàn. Duìle, nǐ yào mǎi xiézi ba?","english":"It’s okay; we can come again next weekend. By the way, you want to buy shoes, don’t you?","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老師，國安今天要請假。他發燒了，不能來上課。","pinyin":"Lǎoshī, Guó'ān jīntiān yào qǐngjià. Tā fāshāo le, bù néng lái shàngkè.","english":"Teacher, Guoan has to take a leave today. He has a fever and he can’t come to school.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-1-01","sourceFront":"感冒","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他打電話跟我說，他不能來上課，請我幫他請假。","pinyin":"Tā dǎ diànhuà gēn wǒ shuō, tā bù néng lái shàngkè, qǐng wǒ bāng tā qǐngjià.","english":"He gave me a call and told me that he couldn’t make it to class and asked me to ask for a leave for him.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他說他會去看醫生，請我們不要擔心，如果他好了，就會來學校上課。","pinyin":"Tā shuō tā huì qù kàn yīshēng, qǐng wǒmen bú yào dānxīn, rúguǒ tā hǎo le, jiù huì lái xuéxiào shàngkè.","english":"He said he will go see a doctor and he does not want to worry us. If he feels better, he will come to school.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"原來是十二生肖，真的很有意思。","pinyin":"Yuánlái shì shí'èr shēngxiào, zhēnde hěn yǒuyìsi.","english":"Oh! You are talking about the Chinese animal zodiac! It’s really interesting.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"原來越南的生肖跟中國的有點兒不一樣。","pinyin":"Yuánlái Yuènán de shēngxiào gēn Zhōngguó de yǒudiǎnr bù yíyàng.","english":"It turns out that the Vietnamese zodiac animals are a little bit different from the Chinese ones.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-01","sourceFront":"生肖","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L05-2-09\",\"客廳\",\"客廳\",\"客厅\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"爸爸在客廳喝咖啡。","pinyin":"Bàba zài kètīng hē kāfēi.","english":"Dad is drinking coffee in the living room.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-09","sourceFront":"客廳","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"客廳裡面有兩張沙發。","pinyin":"Kètīng lǐmiàn yǒu liǎng zhāng shāfā.","english":"There are two sofas in the living room.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-19","sourceFront":"沙發","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"客廳的桌子上有一個錢包，是不是你的？","pinyin":"Kètīng de zhuōzi shàng yǒu yí ge qiánbāo, shì bú shì nǐ de?","english":"In the living room, there is a wallet on the table. Is that yours?","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"那不是我的，是哥哥的。我的錢包不在客廳裡。","pinyin":"Nà bú shì wǒ de, shì gēge de. Wǒ de qiánbāo bú zài kètīng lǐ.","english":"It is not mine. It is my elder brother’s. Mine is not in the living room.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-01","sourceFront":"跟","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"客(guest) + 廳(hall) → the hall where you host guests, so 客廳 is the living room."},{"key":"[\"B1L12-2-06\",\"成绩\",\"成績\",\"成绩\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你這學期的成績進步了，太好了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L12-2-06","sourceFront":"成績","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"老師很滿意大家這次期中考的成績。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-37","sourceFront":"滿意","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他的成績很好，有機會得到出國留學的獎學金。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-13","sourceFront":"得到","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"陳可欣極重視考試的成績，可是她覺得參加社團也會有很多收穫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-20","sourceFront":"重視","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我這次考試的成績不太好，下次我會更加努力的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-25","sourceFront":"更加","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天中文口試時我太緊張了，一時不知道怎麼回答，所以成績不太好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-42","sourceFront":"一時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要得到好成績，除了努力用功，還得學習怎麼利用網路資源。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-05","sourceFront":"資源","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽替我報名了亞洲鋼琴比賽，她說只要我肯努力，一定會有好成績的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-21","sourceFront":"肯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次期末考的題目很難，大家的成績都不好，還有幾個人被當了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-16","sourceFront":"題目","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想得到獎學金，必須達成每科成績八十五分以上的要求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-05","sourceFront":"達成","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那所非常有名的大學每年只錄取一千名新生，除了得成績夠好，還需要一點兒運氣才進得去。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-19","sourceFront":"錄取","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為店員的服務態度很好，所以這個專櫃的銷售成績是最好的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-12","sourceFront":"銷售","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽到老闆跟經理的對話，我才知道公司新產品的銷售成績不理想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-17","sourceFront":"對話","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"方老師非常有耐心，就算學生考試的成績很糟，也從來沒發過脾氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-10","sourceFront":"發脾氣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:今年銷售商品的成績比以往差， 大家都說是你的責任。 B:你是我最好的朋友，連你也這麼認為，我就沒話說了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-41","sourceFront":"沒話說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他以前化學成績常不及格，沒想到現在卻是有名的化學教授。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-05","sourceFront":"化學","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"部分大學科系對學生成績的要求非常高，畢業條件也較嚴格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-14","sourceFront":"科系","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他很聰明，成績又非常好，因此完成初級班的課程後，學校讓他跳過中級，到高級班學習，一連跳了兩級。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-04","sourceFront":"初級","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-01\",\"旅行\",\"旅行\",\"旅行\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我喜歡去旅行，因為可以認識很多有趣的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-1-01","sourceFront":"旅行","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這次去荷蘭旅行的費用很高，因為車票很貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-24","sourceFront":"費用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下課以後，我要跟同學討論去日月潭旅行的事情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-32","sourceFront":"討論","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的旅行很順利，沒有什麼問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-2-10","sourceFront":"順利","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"很多大學生利用暑假去國外旅行或是學語言。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-09","sourceFront":"利用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"旅行的目的除了看風景，還可以了解那個地方的文化特色。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-12","sourceFront":"特色","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"沒想到利用春假出國旅行的人真不少！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-18","sourceFront":"不少","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我買了幾張當地的明信片，這些是這次旅行很好的紀念。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-37","sourceFront":"紀念","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我想趁著暑假去旅行，你有什麼建議嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-2-21","sourceFront":"建議","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我去義大利旅行的時候，不小心把護照弄丟了，我擔心死了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-13","sourceFront":"死","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我不曾一個人去旅行，總是參加團體旅遊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-07","sourceFront":"曾","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我一直想到歐洲去旅行，只是現在忙得沒時間去，希望明年能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-33","sourceFront":"只是","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司很重視員工的身心健康，每年都安排一連五天的環島旅行，家人也可以參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-19","sourceFront":"身心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"跟團體旅遊比起來，我覺得一個人的旅行自由得多，也能訓練自己解決問題的能力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-02","sourceFront":"旅行","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小張對世界地理和歷史相當有興趣，為了打開視野，他決定花一年的時間出國旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-11","sourceFront":"視野","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣護照比以前好用得多，去許多國家旅行都不需要簽證了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-33","sourceFront":"簽證","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"阿里山擁有豐富的森林資源和獨特的自然風景，每年都吸引不少遊客去那裡旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-10","sourceFront":"擁有","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座島的風景很美，旅館價格也很合理，難怪不少遊客年年都來這裡旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-26","sourceFront":"年年","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上次我出國旅行時，護照被偷了，幸好導遊通知了當地的外交人員，很快就辦好了新護照。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-33","sourceFront":"導遊","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"叔叔時常跟我聊他到世界各地旅行的故事，真是有意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-37","sourceFront":"時常","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我心中有兩個夢想，一是當歌星，另一個是去各國旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-05","sourceFront":"另","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果你想到菲律賓旅行，還是帶著美金到當地換錢比較方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-30","sourceFront":"美金","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國外旅行時隨時攜帶護照、信用卡，可讓你玩得安心又順利。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-04","sourceFront":"攜帶","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不少人利用新年期間到國外旅行，國內過年的氣氛就越來越淡了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-42","sourceFront":"氣氛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上個星期我去鄉下旅行，當地人非常好客。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-08","sourceFront":"好客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一個國家光是依靠免費簽證，是無法吸引國外遊客來旅行的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-32","sourceFront":"光是","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"參加旅行團或自助旅遊各有各的優點，懶得自己安排行程的人，就跟著導遊走吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-12","sourceFront":"旅行團","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們工廠與那家旅行社有合作關係，廠內員工如果報名他們的旅行團，都可以享受優惠價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-14","sourceFront":"旅行社","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"旅行團的行程及路線是公司及導遊決定的，不喜歡的話，就只能自助旅遊了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-15","sourceFront":"路線","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個旅行團的目的地是中國北京(Beijing)，旅客目的是參觀古蹟及拜訪朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-17","sourceFront":"目的地","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我去英國留學時，常利用週末到旅行社打工，帶觀光客到著名的景點觀光。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-31","sourceFront":"觀光客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校每學期都帶學生到郊外旅行，體驗大自然的美好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-35","sourceFront":"郊外","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我夢想有一天可以到世界各地旅行。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-41","sourceFront":"夢想","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我請旅行社代訂從台北直飛美國的班機，機票較貴，但能節省不少時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-44","sourceFront":"直飛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我去澳洲登山時，碰見了正在自助旅行的老朋友，真巧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-01","sourceFront":"碰見","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次長途旅行不僅行程豐富，並且讓我交到了不少朋友、擴大了視野。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-20","sourceFront":"長途","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每年安排一段時間去旅行，說不定能帶給你更豐富的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-20","sourceFront":"說不定","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從去年伯母退休後，就帶著伯父到處去旅行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-21","sourceFront":"伯母","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"去旅行的話，我有法子讓你用最少的預算擁有最豐富的行程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-43","sourceFront":"法子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他在國外旅行時因為簽證有問題，回國時間只好提前了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-18","sourceFront":"提前","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對他來說，這趟旅行的唯一目的僅是為了尋找畫畫的題材。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-16","sourceFront":"唯一","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"千萬別帶著笨重的行李去旅行，那會給你帶來很多麻煩。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-26","sourceFront":"笨重","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家旅行社有宣傳活動，所以裡頭、外頭都站滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-42","sourceFront":"外頭","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在人生地不熟的地方旅行時，如有當地人帶路，就可以節省不少時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-02","sourceFront":"帶路","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"難得出國旅行，一定要多照幾張相片留念。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-18","sourceFront":"留念","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我旅行的方式很隨意，出發前從不先規劃行程。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-34","sourceFront":"隨意","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時改變原來旅行的安排，可能會帶來不同的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-38","sourceFront":"原來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要前往國外旅行，得先確認當地現在的氣候，好收拾行李。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-27","sourceFront":"前往","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"出國旅行最好辦個保險，發生意外時才能獲得保障。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-08","sourceFront":"獲得","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"旅(journey) + 行(go) → to go on a journey, to travel."},{"key":"[\"B2L03-2-18\",\"租屋網站\",\"租屋網站\",\"租屋网站\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L05-2-12\",\"花園\",\"花園\",\"花园\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我家有一個小花園，媽媽有空就在那裡種花、剪草。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-04","sourceFront":"剪","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有的房子前院、後院都有花園，住起來一定很舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-25","sourceFront":"後院","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"從我辦公室隔著玻璃往外看，可以看見開滿鮮花的花園。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-09","sourceFront":"隔","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L08-1-30\",\"变成\",\"變成\",\"变成\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"以前沒什麼人喜歡露營，可是最近露營變成了一種流行的活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-30","sourceFront":"變成","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"香蕉還沒成熟的時候是綠色的，等變成黃色就熟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-14","sourceFront":"成熟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有人說，有夢最美。應該趁著年輕勇敢地做夢，更要努力讓夢想變成真的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-18","sourceFront":"做夢","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"美美剛進模特兒公司時，有一位導演找她演戲，沒想到就讓她變成了有名的明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-12","sourceFront":"進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個城市的變化很大，不少老房屋已經變成新大樓了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-21","sourceFront":"變化","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"越來越多人使用網路上課，所以手機、電腦也就變成了重要的學習工具。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-23","sourceFront":"工具","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"天上有無數個星星，聚在一起就變成了美麗的銀河。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-14","sourceFront":"無數","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"奶奶把變黃的蔬菜葉子埋在地裡，讓它變成草地的營養。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-40","sourceFront":"埋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"所有令人傷腦筋的過程，都是為了使自己變成腦筋很好的人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-40","sourceFront":"腦筋","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"網路直播的內容各種各樣，甚至有人因為直播平日生活而變成明星。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-13","sourceFront":"直播","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"故事中的女主角吻了白馬一下，白馬就變成了英俊的國王。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-18","sourceFront":"吻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-2-25\",\"寶貴\",\"寶貴\",\"宝贵\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"時間很寶貴，我們應該要趁著年輕多讀書、多學習。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-2-25","sourceFront":"寶貴","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"醫生的工作是讓病人恢復健康，甚至把寶貴的生命救回來，所以我們應該尊敬醫生。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-37","sourceFront":"生命","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"便利的交通，不僅縮短了南北城市的距離，也節省了人們寶貴的時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-28","sourceFront":"縮短","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"打仗期間，許多軍人為國家犧牲了寶貴的生命，也給家人留下了痛苦的記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-14","sourceFront":"打仗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"博物館裡的東西非常寶貴， 它們具有民族和文化的價值， 沒辦法用錢算清楚的","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-26","sourceFront":"價值","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"動不動就發脾氣的人，往往無法接受別人的寶貴建議。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-33","sourceFront":"動不動","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"戰爭雖然勝利了，這個國家卻也失去了許多寶貴的生命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-23","sourceFront":"勝利","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L13-1-04\",\"差别\",\"差別\",\"差别\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"請你說明一下，這些產品的功能有什麼差別？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-06","sourceFront":"功能","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這兩臺機器樣子相同，但在構造與功能上是有差別的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-14","sourceFront":"構造","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當室內與戶外溫度的差別很大時，我就容易感冒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-09","sourceFront":"室內","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-2-05\",\"节日\",\"節日\",\"节日\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"「教師節」這個節日是為了紀念偉大的孔子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-2-05","sourceFront":"節日","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"每次到了特別的節日，張先生就會送鮮花給太太，真是浪漫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-35","sourceFront":"鮮花","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人社會中有很多重要的節日，比方(說)中秋節、農曆